{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他舍不得从前自在的生活，想到以后再也回不去会慌，于是提醒自己曾经受过的气，别因为心软忘了离开的理由。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舍不得、慌张、克制、不甘心\",\n      \"missed\": \"波兰舞曲外表庄严、内里脆弱的反差；反复说“我没事”、整理衣服再抬头等自我控制的动作细节；右上角“离开后才发现心里空了”也不容易第一眼注意到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他舍不得过去的自在，又不断提醒自己受过的气，不敢轻易心软，但也不甘心连以前的好日子一起放弃。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、慌张、警惕、压抑、不甘心\",\n      \"missed\": \"音乐上推又退、三连音催得呼吸越来越急、最后仍没落稳的变化；外表维持镇定、内心仍然在意的具体动作。这些需要读小字才能理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他在怀念过去和提醒自己不要忘记受过的伤之间挣扎，既不想回到过去受气，也不愿意把曾经的好日子全部丢掉。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、焦灼、克制、矛盾、不甘心\",\n      \"missed\": \"音乐起伏与人物呼吸、情绪之间的对应关系；反复说没事和整理衣服的自我控制细节。底部音符动画能看出音乐在运动，但单凭点线变化不容易读出具体的情绪含义。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三条大字叙述都比较长，而且视觉分量接近，第一眼虽然能抓到舍不得、受过的气、不甘心几个核心意思，却不容易立刻判断哪一条是这一屏最重要的落点。音乐变化和整理衣服等画面细节都放在较小的文字里，人物处境、内心感受与音乐画面之间的联系需要进一步阅读才能完整建立。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ec5a6259-2bcd-4454-b8f9-bb0afbb37ec4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T000634580894Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:07:57.234806+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c6450487d08f38292b571402eb294d78ad385f95d8439d10ad5326aee76ea303", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T000634580894Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "20260a2673a47eeeb64155b0acc77f15d5ee8313f47e10fa05f680c09afc58e8"}}}
